# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

*storybook.log
storybook-static

# Compodoc output. Regenerated by both Storybook targets (compodoc: true in
# angular.json) before webpack resolves .storybook/preview.ts's import of it, so
# a fresh clone builds fine without it. Tracking it dirtied the tree after every
# build, which blocked release-it's requireCleanWorkingDir check.
# Compodoc output. The Storybook builder writes the first path; a compodoc run
# with `-d .` writes the second, which is how a 2.2 MB blob nearly landed in a
# commit once.
projects/fsociety/documentation.json
/documentation.json

# Local agent tooling state
.atl/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Índice de CodeGraph. Es un SQLite atado a la ruta absoluta de este checkout,
# así que cada worktree necesita el suyo — compartirlo no sirve.
.codegraph/
